{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50600","headline":"句 · 李揆","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"免相践蓬阁，卧痾淮海滨。\n偶逢潘川守，宛是洛阳亲。\n（「洛阳」，《四部丛刊》影明本、中华上编本《唐诗纪事》皆作「潘阳」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}